        <item>
            <title>0.11.2</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 11 Sep 2026 17:03:13 +0200</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>1102</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.11.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Jarvis 0.11.2</h2>
<p><b>Task finder reliability (service-side).</b> The shared model service now
accepts the finder's current model, so the task finder runs for everyone on the
shared connection — not just people using their own API key.</p>
<ul>
  <li>Fixes the task finder stalling ("Could not decide" with no work shown) for
      people signed in to the shared service.</li>
  <li>No changes to the app itself, your data, your Slack connection, or what
      leaves your Mac.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
